{"data":{"body":"[P2] Keep the explicit empty payload round-trip safe. `EventError.from_dict()` treats `Payload: {}` as absent, so web/cloud history loses the field added here while direct in-process history retains it. Direct `events_to_operations()` also converts this all-`None` object into a non-`None` callback error, making `DurableFunctionTestResult` differ by runner path. Track payload presence during parsing/serialization and normalize an empty payload to `None` when rebuilding callback state; add history round-trip and `from_execution_history` tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM77K5bA","finding_digest":"768fe440b515aeaf97027db956a368696168931b9950e45471b7603eadcbc3bf","finding_id":"arf_v1_o2h6iqfvcwxk7fycpw4vni3inf","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-testing/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python_testing/model.py::create_callback_event_failed::empty-payload-roundtrip","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-testing/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python_testing/model.py::create_callback_event_failed::empty-payload-roundtrip","line":2249,"observation_digest":"0fb31b07f2b3afdbcb6971c98084f20f376e296ac3c204485414295cf3d476ea","observation_id":"aro_v1_b6zrwb7swox5xs3joheybbhsb4","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-testing/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python_testing/model.py","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-08T02:16:36Z","review_id":"arr_v1_3p5egzowtdmu2c4gjhfaegxu67","reviewed_base_sha":"ef683592fbd3edb48c20b880d859c294bc0ae7a0","reviewed_head_sha":"cd81a3d6d3f63f7d083aa3df81dfb46500a90272","reviewer":"codex","start_line":2249,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":758},"record_id":"art_v1_kdtrucen3rihn7f7koorulmcij","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T02:16:36Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
